Error [E0108]: `HookDecision.Fail` needs String (text), not Int (a whole number)
  --> tests/ui/decision_hook_wrong_handler.jet:6:54
    |
  6 |     hook.on(scope, (value: Int) => HookDecision.Fail(value))
    |                                                      ^^^^^
 Why: the decision payload must match the hook's declared payload or error type
 Fix: put the value in text with interpolation: "{x}"
